'''Gavin Kratt''' (born June 1, 2001), also known as '''Dead Hendrix''', is an [[American-Canadian]] rapper and singer based in [[Ottawa]]. Originally a recurring cast member on the [[PBS Kids]] animated series ''[[Wild Kratts]]'', he began releasing music in 2020, with releases of note being the 2023 single "Mustang" in collaboration with Yungcudii and the 2022 EP ''Dead Summer'' in collaboration with Levi Zadoff.<ref>{{cite web |title=Dead Hendrix gets an assist from Yungcudii on genre-bending "MUSTANG." |url=https://blog.lyricallemonade.com/p/dead-hendrix-gets-an-assist-from-yungcudii-on-genre-bending-mustang/ |website=Lyrical Lemonade |date=May 10, 2023 |access-date=12 October 2023}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=DEAD HENDRIX: THE PUNK RAPSTAR CARVING HIS OWN NICHE IN THE MUSIC INDUSTRY |url=https://thesource.com/2023/04/10/dead-hendrix-the-punk-rapstar-carving-his-own-niche-in-the-music-industry-2/ |website=The Source |date=April 10, 2023 |access-date=12 October 2023}}</ref> In 2023 Dead Hendrix was featured on Allcapyow's 2023 album release "Ottawa x Toronto" alongside Toronto rapper 3MFrench.<ref>{{cite web |title=OTTAWA AND TORONTO RAPPERS UNITE ON ALLCAPYOW'S NEW PROJECT OTTAWA X TORONTO |url=https://shiftermagazine.com/music/ottawa-and-toronto-rappers-unite-allcapyow-ottawa-x-toronto |website=Shifter Magazine |date=June 27, 2023 |access-date=12 October 2023}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=OTTAWA X TORONTO ft J CREOLE, DEAD HENDRIX & SLEEPY 13 On Ottawa Hoods, Toronto's Shadow & More |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l3c0ci2Sh58 |website=YouTube | date=May 11, 2023 |publisher=We Love Hip Hop Network |access-date=12 October 2023}}</ref>

