'''Hustle Gang''' is an American [[hip hop collective]] composed of signees of Grand Hustle, introduced in 2013. The group's debut LP, ''[[G.D.O.D. (Get Dough or Die)|GDOD: Get Dough or Die]]'' was released the same year and co-released by record label Be Music. The group's 2017 releases were distributed by [[Roc Nation]].

=== Smash Factory ===
