'''Navy Wavy''' is an American record label founded by Veeze in 2023. It operates as an imprint of [[Warner Records|Warner]] as of 2024.<ref name="Warner" /> He released his first music video, "Safe 2", under the label on September 14, 2023.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.thefader.com/2023/09/14/veeze-announces-new-warner-records-imprint-navy-wavy-shares-safe-2-video/amp|title=Veeze announces new Warner Records imprint Navy Wavy, shares "Safe 2" video|last=Raphael|first=Helfand|website=[[The Fader]]|date=September 14, 2023|accessdate=January 20, 2024}}<br>-{{cite web|url=https://www.attacktheculture.com/videos/veeze-the-new-york-city-transit-life-is-on-display-in-the-new-safe-2-music-video?format=amp|title=Veeze: The New York City transit life is on display in the new 'Safe 2' music video|last=Cyrus|first=Langhorne|website=The Culture|date=September 15, 2023|accessdate=January 20, 2024}}</ref>

